      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -560,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Grids and vec2 spreads\n\n`GridSpread` emits a Spread<vec2> — one (x,y) per cell. Pass it into a ForEach, then `vec2/split` inside the region to break each vec2 into its x and y, and feed those into a shape.\n\nResult: an 8×8 grid of circles.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Grids and vec2 spreads\n\n`GridSpread` emits a Spread<vec2> — one (x,y) per cell. Pass it into a ForEach, then `vec2/split` inside the region to break each vec2 into its x and y, and feed those into a shape.\n\nResult: an 8×8 grid of circles.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
